Layer Framework Location Coverage Unit pytest <code>tests/unit/</code> Mỗi function riêng, mock model output. Integration pytest <code>tests/integration/</code> End-to-end trên 10 keyframes mẫu, GPU optional (mark <code>@pytest.mark.gpu</code>). Smoke script <code>scripts/smoke_test_metadata.py</code> Manual run trên 1 video đầu. <p>Markers: dùng <code>gpu</code> cho tests cần GPU; <code>slow</code> cho tests &gt; 5s.</p> <p>Fixtures:</p> <pre><code># tests/conftest.py
@pytest.fixture
def sample_keyframe(tmp_path) -&gt; Path:
    """Create a 640x360 dummy keyframe with 2 visible objects."""
    ...

@pytest.fixture
def mock_qwen_output() -&gt; str:
    return '{"triples": [["person", "hold", "cup"], ["person", "sit on", "chair"]]}'

@pytest.fixture
def mock_places365_labels() -&gt; list[str]:
    return ["kitchen", "bedroom", "outdoor", ...]
</code></pre> <p>Coverage target: ≥ 80% cho <code>pipeline/metadata.py</code>, ≥ 90% cho <code>pipeline/places365.py</code>.</p> <p>Key test cases:</p> <ol> <li><code>extract_scene_graph</code> parse JSON đúng → trả về list triples.</li> <li><code>extract_scene_graph</code> model output malformed → log warning + return <code>[]</code>.</li> <li><code>Places365Classifier</code> classify ảnh test → trả về top-5 categories hợp lý.</li> <li><code>position_from_bbox([10, 10, 100, 200])</code> ở ảnh 640x360 → <code>bottom-left</code> (vì x_center &lt; 0.33).</li> <li>End-to-end: load keyframe → run pipeline → JSON sidecar chứa cả 3 fields.</li> <li>JSON sidecar backward-compatible: nếu scene_graph skip thì field đó = <code>null</code>.</li> </ol>
